# Allowlist: the build context is ONLY what the Dockerfiles need. Everything else on the
# server (DB dumps in backups/, uploads, certs, stray caches such as **/200/, logs, deploy
# state) never reaches the Docker daemon — that is what made the context ~338 MB.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!turbo.json
!tsconfig.base.json
!.npmrc
!shared/
!backend/
!frontend/
!worker/

# Re-exclude heavy / local-only paths inside the allowed packages.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.cache
**/200
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
backend/storage
frontend/.vercel
